      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2936 - Ali ibn Abi Hamzah narrated from Imam (as) that he said:\n\"Whoever has the means to perform Hajj but keeps postponing it without any valid excuse that Allah (swt) would accept, and death overtakes him, has neglected a fundamental law of Islam.\""
